<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Oh, so you are just like Sofie! She just started in a new school.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: Are you nervous?
    <<jump AEn1Day1>>
-> Mailman: Oh yeah? Well, enjoy your package!
    <<jump AEnd1Day1>>
<<else>>
...
<<endonce>>
